- keep using sem_wait(3) instead of semop(2) for mutexes.
- enforce MDB_WRITEMAP, because we have no UBC (Unified Buffer Cache).

Index: mdb.c
--- mdb.c.orig
+++ mdb.c
@@ -184,6 +184,12 @@ typedef SSIZE_T	ssize_t;
